## 四、Action 与对象的关系

| Action | 操作的对象 | 状态变更 |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| Dispatch | Task | 🟢→🔨 |
| Complete | Task | 🔨→✅ |
| Review | Task | ✅→✅审查/🔄返工 |
| Snapshot | Snapshot | executing→checkpoint |
| Checkpoint | Checkpoint | created→archived |
| Promote | Feature/ADR/Pitfall | 创建/更新 Knowledge 对象 |
| Archive | Workspace | distilling→archived |
| Recover | Task/Workspace | 🔨→🟢 |

---

